DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi all\,\n\nTake a moment to fill out th
 e Form below and cast your vote!\nThe poll will close on Saturday\, August
  1st at 1pm.\n\n**[Book of the Month Poll!](https://forms.gle/VnpucyCEEqsD
 TegY7)**\n\nA reminder that [The Sci Fi Book Club is also on Discord](http
 s://discord.gg/F3aVbf9HBs).\nJoin us and keep the conversation going!\n\nC
 heers\,\nJon & Meghan\n🪐 🔭
